 -linked note in accordance with statements provided by the financial institution without adjustment due to lack of quoted prices on an active market. As of December 31, 2024 and 2025, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_YQYnjBUfVkKlgHZPDi4wHw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_us-gaap_FinancialInstrumentAxis_xyf_FundLinkedNotesMember_IdlPQDklbk2qGx6kYnzOHQ" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:DebtSecuritiesAvailableForSaleAllowanceForCreditLoss" scale="0" id="Narr_JXU1crVpVUy55Y3G5jPaFw"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_YQYnjBUfVkKlgHZPDi4wHw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_FinancialInstrumentAxis_xyf_FundLinkedNotesMember_aXZMnG-6VUCqf4a6kiNDMw" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:DebtSecuritiesAvailableForSaleAllowanceForCreditLoss" scale="0" id="Narr_b2fEB_FfdU-Ss0sJqKzu-g">no</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> credit loss was recorded for the investments, since fair value is greater than amortized cost.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">In 2024, the Group redeemed all the U.S. Treasury securities with original maturities over three months and RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_YQYnjBUfVkKlgHZPDi4wHw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_us-gaap_FinancialInstrumentAxis_xyf_WealthManagementProductsWithNoFixedTermMember_6wqU101v80S7yPzz8XTSiw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromSaleOfAvailableForSaleSecuritiesDebt" scale="0" id="Narr_vnQLyZFcOkOeYJN1VIVFfg">326,818,365</ix:nonFraction> of wealth management products. In 2025, the Group invested RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_YQYnjBUfVkKlgHZPDi4wHw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_FinancialInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_USTreasurySecuritiesMember_cB5qF2WhEEWh-vXQKnHz4A" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireAvailableForSaleSecuritiesDebt" scale="0" id="Narr_VpM3dHVzz0yt