ement, the historical assets (which refer to assets other than equity of Newup Bank of Liaoning, same below), claims or debts and other actual or potential profits or losses, which are generated before the closing date or after the closing date but attributable to reasons before the closing date, as described in the agreement, shall be enjoyed and borne by the original shareholder, the Group will not bear any historical assets, claims or debts set forth. The significant influence can be given by the Group as the Group has representation on the board and thus equity method was applied. For this long-term investment as of December 31, 2025, the Group recorded cumulative impairment losses of RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_YQYnjBUfVkKlgHZPDi4wHw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_JPSOWL18b0mRymlbaDz_Xg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xyf:EquityMethodInvestmentCumulativeImpairmentLoss" scale="0" id="Narr_avPxAWz98Uu_hERRUPtydA">95,877,250</ix:nonFraction> (US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_mso-ZoIOikybqHvJnzvpJA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_JPSOWL18b0mRymlbaDz_Xg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xyf:EquityMethodInvestmentCumulativeImpairmentLoss" scale="0" id="Narr_rFndjGQVQ0iu1DiB4RuNQw">13,710,264</ix:nonFraction>), of which RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_YQYnjBUfVkKlgHZPDi4wHw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_JPSOWL18b0mRymlbaDz_Xg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xyf:EquityMethodInvestmentCumulativeImpairmentLossAttributableToGoodwill" scale="0" id="Narr_hPRR_tYsTECA_Get8PY7Ag">74,940,264</ix:nonFraction> (US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_mso-ZoIOikybqHvJnzvpJA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_JPSOWL18b0mRymlbaDz_Xg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xyf:EquityMethodInvestmentCumulativeImpairmentLossAttributableToGoodwill" scale="0" id="Narr_yFX5YjdP3E6FYHLIiXhmkQ">10,716,315</ix:nonFraction>) was due to goodwill. The Group recorded impairment losses of RMB<ix: