TLmqG2Lg">13,843,645</ix:nonFraction> of stock options. On June 29, 2015, May 3, 2016, October 11, 2017, April 30, 2018, October 31, 2018 and April 30, 2019, the Board of Directors of X Financial granted <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_NMqbQ0zKMUm5UWX49YbyhQ" contextRef="Duration_6_29_2015_To_6_29_2015_DCC252BMK0Wtdb80eeQ5lQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" scale="0" id="Narr_06WHSSclg02yLzJ230ZqyA">630,000</ix:nonFraction>, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_NMqbQ0zKMUm5UWX49YbyhQ" contextRef="Duration_5_3_2016_To_5_3_2016_rQXaa7A7MkC5-QRlW5tRbQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" scale="0" id="Narr_0W3AHptvYUC5pcM9MC91xg">7,425,000</ix:nonFraction>, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_NMqbQ0zKMUm5UWX49YbyhQ" contextRef="Duration_10_11_2017_To_10_11_2017_GgezJEL7Wk6_7KXuPL3RXQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" scale="0" id="Narr_1Hf5sVK2IU299Cvpvh1TQw">16,616,000</ix:nonFraction>, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_NMqbQ0zKMUm5UWX49YbyhQ" contextRef="Duration_4_30_2018_To_4_30_2018_euJXy-5O1EK9NWVRJ53OCQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" scale="0" id="Narr_7QCjrC2nIkafpwNR3FKEiQ">841,054</ix:nonFraction>, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_NMqbQ0zKMUm5UWX49YbyhQ" contextRef="Duration_10_31_2018_To_10_31_2018_IXdCRMP3_ku2yvN3F1XuFQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" scale="0" id="Narr_g2fZB3FpRUiT5o1h7NYe4Q">475,000</ix:nonFraction> and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_NMqbQ0zKMUm5UWX49YbyhQ" contextRef="Duration_4_30_2019_To_4_30_2019_Pe65kQq_CEGH3l-cAQ_myg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" scale="0" id="Narr_oQ6AeGLDq0yXELljJFcOpQ">155,000</ix:nonFraction> stock options respectively to certain employees, directors and officers. The stock options shall expire <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_Yy6Jg489uEiAjI1FBjE_Pg" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardExpirationPeriod" id="Narr_m5KztxMV2keg7VxwbydMRg">10 years</ix:nonNumeric> from the date of grant and vest over a period from <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_FE-RGH8qHkKLlFRLPHZtoQ;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">three</span></span> to <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_Xfr5QqgiLEOWpUwrSZa09A" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_2zVpdrHoJUel5pi1kDGSaA">four years</ix:nonNumeric>. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On May 9, 2018, the Board of Directors of X Financial granted <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_NMqbQ0zKMUm5UWX49YbyhQ" contextRef="Duration_5_9_2018_To_5_9_2018__n63SYNlekW2VjQU33MPgw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" scale="0" id="Narr_NwYlOLRz9UmvjfAaUPQgVw">40,000,000</ix:nonFraction> share options to certain senior management. The exercise price was the offering price per share of the Group&#8217;s IPO which was US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_bIx1MrBb80OPhGT_fNi7bA" contextRef="Duration_5_9_2018_To_5_9_2018__n63SYNlekW2VjQU33MPgw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementsByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageExercisePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_G2TuNs8M8km5erAivSVyOQ">4.75</ix:nonFraction>, and were eligible to vest, in whole or in part, when both the market capitalization milestone as well as the targeted adjusted net earnings were achieved subsequent to the IPO. The Company determined the service inception date to be May 9, 2018 and the grant date to be the date of the IPO.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On November 10, 2021, the board of directors of X Financial decided to cancel <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_NMqbQ0zKMUm5UWX49YbyhQ" contextRef="Duration_11_10_2021_To_11_10_2021_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_xyf_ShareBasedPaymentArrangementOptionMember_ZpF_XEU8O0y9BhOGqeaDYg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xyf:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsNonVestedOptionsCanceledNumberOfShares" scale="0" id="Narr_5Htqweu_DU6WVosbif5-sg">9,429,984</ix:nonFraction> of unvested share options granted to certain senior management.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">The Company used the Binomial model to estimate the fair value of the options granted on the respective grant dates with assistance from independent valuation firms. The fair value per option was estimated at the date of grant using the assumptions below. The weighted-average grant date fair value of the options for the years ended December 31, 2023, 2024 and 2025 were RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_CNY_shares_L-ByK7HU80SmmR3ZUeDL2Q" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_m3ttgOpLq0Wvv9FHxPAKWQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAvera